---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Awards & Accreditations"
description: "Abatec's industry awards and professional accreditations, including REC membership and Constructionline Gold status."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">Home</a> / About Us / Awards &amp; Accreditations</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1>Recognition we've earned, not claimed.</h1>
    <p>From industry body membership to national recruitment awards, our accreditations are the compliance backbone that lets tier-one contractors and growing SMEs trust us with their critical hires.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Accreditations</span>
      <h2>Compliance, verified.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--4">
      {% for a in site.accreditations %}
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__icon">✓</div>
        <h3>{{ a.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ a.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--slate">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Awards</span>
      <h2>Recognised across the industry</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Weston College Business Awards</h3>
        <p>Winner, 2022</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Medium Employer of the Year</h3>
        <p>Business Leader Awards, 2022 (Finalist) &amp; 2015 (Winner)</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>UK Recruitment Awards, South West</h3>
        <p>2017</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Business of the Year (11&ndash;50 Employees)</h3>
        <p>Business Leader Awards, Finalist 2017</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Weston College Career Excellence Hub</h3>
        <p>Partner organisation</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Future Net Zero Standard</h3>
        <p>Benchmark Certified</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>See the delivery behind the awards.</h2>
        <p>Read how we've applied this track record to live client programmes.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/for-clients/case-studies/' | url }}">View case studies</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
